        "created_at": "2018-04-26T03:48:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I thought it’d be spelled ‘Qwghlm!’ <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"></p>\n<p>So, first thought: how many SASEs do you think will arrive at GtG next week?</p>\n<p>Second thought: why does the Portal Fiend card just do damage, instead of something…portaly? It could put the non-character target with the lowest HP under the top card of the environment deck, or something.</p>\n<p>Edit: Also also wik, I would listen the heck out of a “Christopher and Adam come up with supervillain doomsday plots” episode.</p>",
